{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/improvement-notice-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2026","content_id":"83d94093-629f-4407-b120-2a34021739b4","description":"An improvement notice issued to Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole Council to improve services for children and young people with SEND.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a4d0e1fb485085e13ca48b7","filename":"Improvement_notice_issued_to_Bournemouth__Christchurch_and_Poole_Council_April_2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":1098537,"filename":"Improvement_notice_issued_to_Bournemouth__Christchurch_and_Poole_Council_April_2026.pdf","id":"9382337","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"Improvement notice issued to Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole Council: April 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4d0e1fb485085e13ca48b7/Improvement_notice_issued_to_Bournemouth__Christchurch_and_Poole_Council_April_2026.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This improvement notice replaces the <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> statutory direction issued to Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole Council on 26 February 2024.</p>\n\n<p>The Department for Education (<abbr title=\"Department for Education\">DfE</abbr>) recognises the progress made by the local area partnership in addressing the significant areas of weakness identified in their 2021 <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/2532287\">Ofsted and Care Quality Commission (CQC) <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> report</a>. The council and its partners have submitted a Local Area <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> Reform Plan, which is subject to <abbr title=\"Department for Education\">DfE</abbr> review and approval.</p>\n\n<p>The improvement notice provides continued oversight while <abbr title=\"Department for Education\">DfE</abbr> seeks assurance that the improvements identified in the Local Area <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> inspection published on 8 February 2026 will be sustained in the long term. This assurance will be provided through the approval of a high-quality Local Area <abbr title=\"special educational needs and disabilities\">SEND</abbr> Reform Plan that demonstrates the local area’s ability to maintain and build on the progress made to date.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-09T08:30:12Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["9382337"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-09T09:30:12.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-07-09T09:30:12+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/improvement-notice-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2026","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/improvement-notice-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2026","base_path":"/government/publications/improvement-notice-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2026","content_id":"83d94093-629f-4407-b120-2a34021739b4","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"